  - key: how.title
    text: HOW TO PLAY
  - key: how.page
    text: '{0} / {1}'
  - key: how.1
    text: 'Climb each haunted tower to the lantern above. Every room has a fork: take the ledges of the waking world, or enter a doorway.


      <color=#41e0d0>TEAL doors</color> open the Spirit world: new ledges appear, but your shadow follows your path 4 seconds behind. Any door is refuge.


      <color=#c07dff>VIOLET doors</color> flip gravity upward: walk off a ledge and rise to the next. Rise to HOME above.'
  - key: how.2
    text: '<color=#ff6b5a>Red</color> means danger. <color=#ffd36a>Gold</color> means safety. <color=#41e0d0>Teal</color> marks spirit paths.


      DASH spends flame and makes you untouchable for a moment. WARD stuns or harms creatures and parries the Bellkeeper''s toll.


      Light the lanterns to save your progress.'
  - key: how.3
    text: '<color=#ffd36a>LETTERS</color> hidden in each tower are more than memos. Every one you find teaches Tala a new skill: double jump, the Lambong veil, the Liwanag bolt, and more.


      Keys: A/D or arrows move. Space jump. Q dash. F ward. C veil. X bolt. E door. Esc pause.


      Gamepad and touch are supported.'
