  - key: credits.title
    text: CREDITS
  - key: credits.body
    text: 'Game concept: Karylle G. Torres and Pangkat Parol (CSEL).

      Built by Karylle G. Torres.


      Inspired by Filipino folklore: the Anino, Tikbalang, Manananggal and the balete tree.


      Font: Press Start 2P by CodeMan38, SIL Open Font License 1.1.


      Art and sound are original to Sa Kabilang Pinto.'
