  - key: lola.name
    text: LOLA
  - key: lola.sub
    text: THE LANTERN PATH
  - key: lola.first.1
    text: Apo, you came home late. The bell has been calling for you since the fiesta began.
  - key: lola.first.2
    text: Every lantern on this path is a room of the old house. Walk to one and open its door.
  - key: lola.first.3
    text: Teal doors lead to the spirit world, but your shadow will follow behind you. Violet doors turn the world upside down. Gold light is always safe.
  - key: lola.first.4
    text: 'Look for the folded letters hidden in each room. They are more than memories. Each one will teach you something: to leap twice, to hide in a veil, to throw light.'
  - key: lola.first.5
    text: Light the lanterns in order. When you reach the last bell, I will be waiting.
  - key: lola.cleared
    text: Salamat, apo. The house is quiet at last. Come back and walk the path whenever you like.
  - key: lola.act1
    text: The house wakes slowly. Stay near the gold light. When your shadow starts to follow, any door is a place to rest.
  - key: lola.act2a
    text: The roots flash before they strike, apo. Count the flash, then move. And the black water rises faster than you think.
  - key: lola.act2b
    text: A tikbalang laughs to pull you off the path. Do not follow it. Use your ward, then slip past. Something with wings hunts above the corridor, so keep your flame close.
  - key: lola.act3
    text: The Bellkeeper only listens to its own toll. Use your ward when the golden ring closes on you.
  - key: level.node
    text: '{0}. {1}'
  - key: level.endless.sub
    text: ENDLESS NIGHTMARE - LOOP {0}
  - key: level.endless.intro
    text: The house loops. Rooms rise, water climbs, and every dimension bites harder. Climb as high as you can.
  - key: clue.name
    text: A LETTER, FOLDED SMALL
  - key: clue.sub
